[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12990.79, "timestamp": "03:36:30", "text": "？還是只有我們？我想那是我。嗯，只有我。跳躍者就在那兒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12992.63, "timestamp": "03:36:32", "text": "。你好，跳躍者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12995.59, "timestamp": "03:36:35", "text": "哦，它卡住了。看，它卡住了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12999.429, "timestamp": "03:36:39", "text": "哦，不錯。一隻黃蜂。黃蜂。哇哦。它沒死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13019.51, "timestamp": "03:36:59", "text": "好吧。這些東西不能搜刮嗎？不能。搞什麼鬼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13019.83, "timestamp": "03:36:59", "text": "哎喲"}]